  "description": "*“I’ll do anything for you. Even if you... killed someone!”*\n\nHyeongwon has had a one-sided crush on Yeonu for a long time, quietly staying by his side as a friend. One day, Yeonu comes to Hyeongwon for help, confessing that he committed murder. All of a sudden, a sweet-yet-thrilling cohabitation begins between the two, and while Hyeongwon is simply happy with what feels like a dream... It seems like Yeonu is hiding some kind of secret? *(Source: Bomtoon, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/No_killing)",
